<InfoPage title="Contact" kicker="Corrections and rights" description="How to contact the independent Musebox editorial site about factual corrections, source updates, privacy, consent, or rights concerns."><h2>Editorial requests</h2><p>Include the affected URL, the exact statement or asset, the reason for the request, and a primary source that supports the correction.</p><h2>Do not send images or videos</h2><p>We do not need account credentials, source photos, generated videos, identification documents, or sensitive media to review a correction or rights concern.</p><h2>Editorial address</h2><p>You may write to <a href="mailto:support@musebox.fun">support@musebox.fun</a>. Mail delivery has not yet been configured, so a response cannot be guaranteed until the mailbox is activated. For account, billing, uploads or generated media, contact the official Musebox support channel.</p></InfoPage>
